E           List:    tar -tf <archive-filename>
E           Extract: tar -xf <archive-filename>
E           Create:  tar -cf <archive-filename> [filenames...]
E           Help:    tar --help
E         this database has been migrated past what the release you are going back to carries, so re-pinning it would put older code in front of a newer schema. Nothing has been changed. Going back from here means the backup taken before the update that moved it
